# Investment platform worker — supercronic schedule.
#
# Timezone: container TZ is set via docker-compose (America/New_York).
# Schedule below uses that local TZ.
#
# 03:30 local, Tue–Sat → processes the prior trading day's data after
# end-of-day bars are finalized.
#
# Columns: m h dom mon dow  command

30 3 * * 2-6    /app/scripts/run_daily_loop.sh
